                                    <property name="margin-end">4</property>
                                    <property name="label" translatable="yes">These fields determine how far devices connected to the drivers move for a given command. The numbers may range into hundreds of thousands for devices with gear ratios. Negative numbers are accepted to change the direction of travel.
</property>
